Package: populismaxis
Title: Proposition-Defined Continuous Text Scales
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Aleksandar", "Tomašević", email = "atomashevic@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Define proposition-based continuous text scales, fit reusable
    references and apply explicit threshold labels. Provides an R interface
    to the matching Python engine through reticulate, preserving the frozen
    populism preset and durable JSON objects. Python dependencies are managed
    on first use; model downloads require explicit permission.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: reticulate (>= 1.45.0), jsonlite, digest
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
